      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.24,
          "end": 3.86,
          "en": "So, lets tackle routing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.86,
          "end": 6.14,
          "en": "As mentioned, it would be nice to be redirected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.14,
          "end": 9.47,
          "en": "after logging in or after logging out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.47,
          "end": 13,
          "en": "So, the trivial way of doing that is the folly:",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13,
          "end": 18,
          "en": "Here on the Auth page once we're done with logging in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.09,
          "end": 21.59,
          "en": "so here inside of the try plug though, not if we failed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.59,
          "end": 23.19,
          "en": "but instead of try.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.19,
          "end": 26.68,
          "en": "So, if we didn't get an error and these actions were done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.68,
          "end": 31.63,
          "en": "then we can reach out to this router and use replaced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.63,
          "end": 34.96,
          "en": "to navigate away, replace instead of push",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.96,
          "end": 38.21,
          "en": "so that we can't go back because if we just log in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.21,
          "end": 41.76,
          "en": "going back to the login page doesn't make a lot of sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.76,
          "end": 45.16,
          "en": "And here we can then go to /coaches for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.16,
          "end": 47.22,
          "en": "Now, something similar can be done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.22,
          "end": 48.48,
          "en": "when we log out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.48,
          "end": 52.26,
          "en": "In the header here when we click log out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.26,
          "end": 57.11,
          "en": "besides dispatching we can redirect to /coaches",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.64,
          "end": 61.29,
          "en": "or to /auth wherever you wanna go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.29,
          "end": 63.42,
          "en": "I'll go to coaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.42,
          "end": 65.38,
          "en": "Now, that's a simple way of redirecting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.38,
          "end": 67.353,
          "en": "Now, if I do log in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.162,
          "end": 71.57,
          "en": "and I will log in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.57,
          "end": 73.99,
          "en": "I am on the all coaches page, if a log out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.99,
          "end": 78.53,
          "en": "and let's say I go to requests first; I also go to coaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.53,
          "end": 81.37,
          "en": "Okay, so that works, but that's only the simple way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.37,
          "end": 85.26,
          "en": "of doing it because of what if I visit all coaches,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.26,
          "end": 88.88,
          "en": "I'm not logged in and I click this login button here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.88,
          "end": 91.14,
          "en": "Now, actually, what I wanted to do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.14,
          "end": 94.49000000000001,
          "en": "is probably register as a coach.",
