        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.49000000000001,
          "end": 98.86,
          "en": "We can make this clear up by going to the coaches list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.86,
          "end": 103.753,
          "en": "and say, log in to register as coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.08,
          "end": 106.953,
          "en": "with that text on the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.77000000000001,
          "end": 112.38,
          "en": "if I reload it should be clear what we wanna do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.38,
          "end": 116.06,
          "en": "So, here after being logged in I probably want to redirect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.06,
          "end": 120.53,
          "en": "not to the all coaches page, but to the registration page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 120.53,
          "end": 124.57,
          "en": "and that's also something we can easily implement with view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 124.57,
          "end": 128.84,
          "en": "For this on coaches list here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.84,
          "end": 131.57,
          "en": "when we link to the off-page on the log",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 131.57,
          "end": 135.61,
          "en": "into register button we can add a query parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.61,
          "end": 138.535,
          "en": "We can do this on local URLs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 138.535,
          "end": 141.34,
