          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.34,
          "end": 144.32999999999998,
          "en": "And for example, add a redirect key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 144.32999999999998,
          "end": 146,
          "en": "though that key is totally up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146,
          "end": 147.74,
          "en": "It can also just be red",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 147.74,
          "end": 149.89,
          "en": "we are going to parse it in a minute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.89,
          "end": 151.31,
          "en": "so, it's up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.31,
          "end": 155.513,
          "en": "So, I will name it redirect and say, register here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 156.61,
          "end": 160.56,
          "en": "Now, with that set if I click on this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 160.56,
          "end": 164.09300000000002,
          "en": "you can see, now we have this query parameter in the URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 165.04,
          "end": 166.49,
          "en": "and now on the Auth page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 166.49,
          "end": 168.87,
          "en": "we can check for this query parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168.87,
          "end": 170.41,
          "en": "And if we do have it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.41,
          "end": 172.3,
          "en": "we can redirect the user somewhere else",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.3,
          "end": 174.523,
          "en": "then our default, which is coaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.17000000000002,
          "end": 179.96,
          "en": "So, for that here, once we did log in or signup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 179.96,
          "end": 184.88,
          "en": "we can get our redirect URL by accessing this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.88,
          "end": 189.54,
          "en": "query that's a field we can access to there redirect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 189.54,
          "end": 194.13,
          "en": "And now this here, this property you access on query",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.13,
          "end": 198.07999999999998,
          "en": "has to be the query parameter you are using here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 198.07999999999998,
          "end": 199.69,
          "en": "I'm using redirect here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.69,
          "end": 201.37,
          "en": "so, I wanna access redirect here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.34,
          "end": 204.253,
          "en": "that's my redirect URL then.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 205.37,
          "end": 210.37,
          "en": "And actually, I'll add a leading slash in front of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 210.617,
          "end": 212.82999999999998,
          "en": "so that I go to the slash,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 212.82999999999998,
          "end": 214.75,
          "en": "and then whatever is stored in redirect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 214.75,
          "end": 217.003,
          "en": "which in my case is register,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219.47,
          "end": 220.86,
          "en": "and that should then lead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 222.93,
          "end": 225.333,
          "en": "to this register route, that's my idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 227.04,
          "end": 227.95,
          "en": "Now, actually, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 227.95,
          "end": 231.42000000000002,
          "en": "we might not always have a redirect URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 231.42000000000002,
          "end": 234.38,
          "en": "and therefore here I will simply wrap this in brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 234.38,
          "end": 236.48,
          "en": "and either you that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 237.61,
          "end": 240.96,
          "en": "or use coaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 240.96,
          "end": 244.27,
          "en": "So, this line of code will construct a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 244.27,
          "end": 247.47,
          "en": "which is either slash and whatever is stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 247.47,
          "end": 251.99,
          "en": "in the redirect query parameter or /coaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 251.99,
          "end": 255.07,
          "en": "And then here we can redirect to our redirect URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 255.07,
          "end": 257.213,
          "en": "which we construct like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 258.28,
          "end": 260.3,
          "en": "With that, if we now save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 260.3,
          "end": 263.623,
          "en": "if I do log in with that query parameters set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 264.72,
          "end": 267.765,
          "en": "you see I go to the registration page thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 267.765,
          "end": 270.32,
          "en": "If on the other hand, I clicked just on log in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 270.32,
          "end": 272.863,
          "en": "and therefore I have no query parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 275.63,
          "end": 277.197,
          "en": "I go to the coaches page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 277.197,
          "end": 279.63,
          "en": "and that I would argue is at least a little bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 279.63,
          "end": 281.463,
          "en": "of a better user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 282.6,
          "end": 284.6,
          "en": "Now, it's not the only thing I wanna do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 284.6,
          "end": 286.74,
          "en": "when it comes to routing though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 286.74,
          "end": 290.03,
          "en": "because redirecting is nice, but we have a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 290.03,
          "end": 294.39,
          "en": "If I'm not logged in, I can't go to the registration page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 294.39,
          "end": 297.18,
          "en": "there is no button that takes me there, but of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 297.18,
          "end": 301.36,
          "en": "we can manually enter slash register and end up there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 301.36,
          "end": 304.79,
          "en": "Sure, we will not be able to submit the data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 304.79,
          "end": 307.86,
          "en": "but it would be better to not even let the user go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 307.86,
          "end": 310.97,
          "en": "to this page if you are, she's not authenticated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 312.07,
          "end": 316.11,
          "en": "and we can use navigation guards to prevent this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 316.11,
          "end": 319.47,
          "en": "You might remember I talked about navigation guards",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 319.47,
          "end": 321.36,
          "en": "in the routing module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 321.36,
          "end": 324.17,
          "en": "Now, we actually need them in this concrete project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 324.17,
          "end": 326.173,
          "en": "to enhance the user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 327.06,
          "end": 332.06,
          "en": "In router js, we can register a global navigation guard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 332.6,
          "end": 336.11,
          "en": "that is triggered before any navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 336.11,
          "end": 339.64,
          "en": "We can attach navigation guards to individual routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 339.64,
          "end": 342.45,
          "en": "We can also attach them to components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 342.45,
          "end": 345.56,
          "en": "I talk about that in the routing module of this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 345.56,
          "end": 347.773,
          "en": "so, check that out for more details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 348.88,
          "end": 353.05,
          "en": "Here, I'm going to use I think pretty elegant approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 353.05,
          "end": 355.29,
          "en": "of using a global navigation guard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 355.29,
          "end": 359.573,
          "en": "which still only affects certain routes and components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 359.573,
          "end": 363.44,
          "en": "Now, to create such a global navigation guard,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 363.44,
          "end": 368.44,
          "en": "we use our router and then here we can call before each",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 368.71,
          "end": 371.4,
          "en": "and define a function that is executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 371.4,
          "end": 373.46,
          "en": "before every navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 373.46,
          "end": 376.89,
          "en": "And here we got this tool from next thing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 376.89,
          "end": 378.593,
          "en": "we got these free parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 380.46,
          "end": 382.92,
          "en": "Now, I will use route metadata,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 382.92,
          "end": 385.48,
          "en": "which are also covered in the routing module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 385.48,
          "end": 388.21,
          "en": "to add special metadata cuter routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 388.21,
          "end": 390.21,
          "en": "that should be protected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 390.21,
          "end": 394.603,
          "en": "that would be the registration and the requests routes here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 395.51,
          "end": 398.3,
          "en": "And actually, also the auth route because here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 398.3,
          "end": 401,
          "en": "I wanna make sure that we can't visit it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 401,
          "end": 403.31,
          "en": "if we are logged in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 403.31,
          "end": 406.01,
          "en": "because if we are logged in going to the Auth page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 406.01,
          "end": 407.223,
          "en": "makes no sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 408.35,
          "end": 412.62,
          "en": "So, we can add this meta key to these route conflicts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 412.62,
          "end": 415.45,
          "en": "and then add any data of our choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 415.45,
          "end": 417.19,
          "en": "Here in this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 417.19,
          "end": 420.703,
          "en": "I will set requiresAuth to true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 421.88,
          "end": 426.4,
          "en": "and I will do the same here for the requests route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 426.4,
          "end": 429.16,
          "en": "And for the throughout I will add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 429.16,
          "end": 433.313,
          "en": "a requiresUnauth key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 434.83,
